<title>UK: Ferguson Intl appoints David Watson as CEO.</title>
<headline>Ferguson Intl appoints David Watson as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferguson International Holdings Plc said on Friday it had appointed David Watson as chief executive of the company.</p>
<p>In a statement Ferguson said Watson would take up his appointment on October 1.</p>
<p>Ronnie Irving resigned as the group's managing director in May following a restructuring to focus on labels and sell its hangers business.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
